{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c27b4e3e-0731-821a-857e-70caff2e067d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:23:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Richard Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:20:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is Richard Almy. I am calling about water in my yard. It happens again after the storm, and I am, honestly, quite tired of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:20:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. Where are you located, Mr. Almy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One Coggeshall Avenue, on Historic Hill. The storm that ended Saturday, three days ago, it brought a lot of rain, and the water still came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:21:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, one Coggeshall. And where's the water coming from, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:21:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It runs down the hill from the next street over and goes straight into my yard. Not a little bit. It comes like a small river."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:21:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow. How deep did it get?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:21:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps. My car was parked in the driveway, and I looked out and the wheels were standing in water. This is not normal for a yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a lot. Let me write this down. One Coggeshall Avenue, runoff coming downhill from the adjacent street, about hubcap deep, after Saturday's storm. Did it drain off afterward?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:21:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Slowly, yes. By Sunday morning it was mostly gone, but the ground is still soft. [pause] I want to know who I should call to get it checked. Somebody must look at the drains up the hill, or the street, I do not know which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's us, actually. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at the drainage on the street above you and around your property line. Can I get a good number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:22:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is four zero one, five five five, zero one five four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:22:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I will say, I am sorry if I sound short with you. I was up late Saturday with my band, I play bass on weekends, and I came home to this. Then Sunday I am moving my car and my boots are wet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:22:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, understandable. Crews are pretty stacked after a storm, so I can't say the exact day, but it's logged and somebody will call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hope so. It is not the first time water comes like this, and each time I am told someone will look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I've noted that it's repeated. You'll get a call from our office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:22:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Almy. Take care."
    }
  ],
